WEBVTT

00:32:02.246 --> 00:32:07.454
The evidence shows that recessions have
unequal effects along racial lines.

00:32:08.288 --> 00:32:11.996
You know, the wage gap between black
and white workers, well,

00:32:11.996 --> 00:32:14.704
Emily found that it grows
during recessions.

00:32:15.621 --> 00:32:19.454
She also discovered that recessions change
people's attitudes about race.

00:32:19.996 --> 00:32:23.704
Her research shows that white people are
more likely to report that inequality

00:32:23.704 --> 00:32:28.704
between races is natural and normal
in the wake of a recession.

00:32:28.746 --> 00:32:31.788
We need to understand how to
overcome this ingroup bias